{"quest_id": 6820, "name": "獣たちの狂走", "description": "王国内に魔物の群れが現れた。\n凶暴化した獣の報告も上がっており、\n一行は事態の鎮圧を急ぐ。\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "白き姫と魔獣の剣", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920131, "map_no": 3414, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 150, "gold": 700, "drops": [{"card": 6, "c": 2}, {"card": 55, "c": 1}, {"item": 1005, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 23, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2800, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 58, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 127, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097264, "master_id": 7, "spawn_sec": 63}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 1000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098672, "master_id": 168, "global_id": 167, "spawn_sec": 75}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 800, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 800, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 111, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098656, "missile_id": 23, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 167, "global_id": 166, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 85}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 19, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "special_effect_id": 64, "master_id": 31837, "global_id": 5456, "spawn_sec": 127}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "――王子、魔物の群れが\n目撃されたのは、この辺りのようです。", "face": "le4da4fde4f27"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "なんだか森が騒がしいね。\n何かにおびえている？\nいや、警戒しているのかな……？", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "何か分かりますか？　ラテリアさん。\n魔物の群れには多数の狼も混じっていたそうですが……。", "face": "le4da4fde4f27"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "うぅん、さすがにここからじゃ分からないよ。\nともかく王子、近くの村に被害が出る前に、\n魔物の群れを倒しちゃおうか。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "それから、兵の報告によれば、\n普段以上に凶暴化した個体がいたそうです。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "凶暴化した獣か……。\n何かの影響を受けているのかな。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "王子、凶暴化した個体は普段以上に俊敏で、\n敵に対しては容赦なく牙を突き立ててくる。\nいつもと同じだって油断しないようにね。", "face": "u532"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 129, "lines": [{"name": "ソーマ", "text": "王子！　あの狼、\n他の狼よりも速く走ってきます！", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "なるほど、あれが凶暴化した個体ってやつだね。\n王子、慎重に対処してね！", "face": "u532"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうにか、魔物の群れを退治できましたね。"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "……狩りのためでもなく、縄張りのためでもない。\nやっぱり凶暴化している連中は、\n何かの影響を受けている気がするね。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "――伝令！　伝令です！\n王子、西方の村が魔物の群れに襲撃されています！", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………！！", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "今のところ、剣士の少女の助太刀により、\nどうにか抑えられていますが、\nこのままでは、おそらく長くは保たないでしょう……。", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、見過ごすことは出来ません。\n急いでその村に向かいましょう！", "face": "le4da4fde4f27"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920131_3414", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 40, "y": 486}, {"k": "m", "x": 803, "y": 362, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 803, "y": 264, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 757, "y": 154, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 626, "y": 120, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 510, "y": 144, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 384, "y": 139, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 257, "y": 150, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 234, "y": 263, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 363, "y": 324, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 468, "y": 257, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 590, "y": 241, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 677, "y": 308, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 686, "y": 432, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 572, "y": 481, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 448, "y": 466, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 325, "y": 433, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 193, "y": 434, "id": 216}, {"k": "r", "x": 742, "y": 382, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 738, "y": 290, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 589, "y": 173, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 465, "y": 183, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 592, "y": 298, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 607, "y": 387, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 426, "y": 362, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 223, "y": 328, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 501, "y": 298, "id": 308}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true}